{
    "name":  "Pulse Meter",
    "systems":  [
                    "Chrome / Edge",
                    "Windows PC",
                    "Android"
                ],
    "tagline":  "Your usage limits at a glance, before you hit the wall.",
    "overview":  "Pulse Meter keeps your claude.ai usage limits on screen: the 5-hour session and the weekly limit, how full each is, and when each resets. It comes three ways: a Chrome / Edge extension that sits on the claude.ai page (v1.0.24), a light native Windows app that floats over the desktop app (v2.2.1), and an Android banner over the phone app (v0.4.1). It reads only your own numbers with your own sign-in; there are no servers and no ads. The extension pictures were taken in Edge on a demo chat page with demo usage numbers. Not made by or affiliated with Anthropic.",
